---
description: Angular ERP KPI, currency and telemetry rules
globs: ["Frontend/sheikhgo-erp/**/*.ts", "Frontend/sheikhgo-erp/**/*.html"]
alwaysApply: false
---

No hardcoded currency symbols. Currency pipe with the tenant's ISO code.
No hardcoded API host. Runtime config only.
KPI values come from a summary endpoint, not computed from a partial list.
Every KPI label states its time window.
Telemetry renders with a Live / Stale / Offline freshness badge; a cached value is
never styled as live.
CNIC renders masked unless the user holds Customer.ViewPII.
Shared streams use shareReplay({bufferSize:1, refCount:true}); never subscribe in
ngOnInit and use an async pipe on the same stream.
Menu visibility uses a View permission, never Create.
